# Kotlin/JVM file system implementation. Forwards to the linked `io` runtime (code/compile/io-runtime SEED_IO_RUNTIME_KOTLIN), which wraps java.io.File and absorbs its checked exceptions so the public file API stays total. Internal: reached only through the public file API.

dock load
  load <global:io>, name io

task read-file
  take path, like text
  like text
  send back
    call io/file-read
      read path

task write-file
  take path, like text
  take data, like text
  like void
  send back
    call io/file-write
      read path
      read data

task read-file-bytes
  take path, like text
  like bytes
  send back
    call io/file-read-bytes
      read path

task write-file-bytes
  take path, like text
  take data, like bytes
  like void
  send back
    call io/file-write-bytes
      read path
      read data

task append-file
  take path, like text
  take data, like text
  like void
  send back
    call io/file-append
      read path
      read data

task remove-file
  take path, like text
  like void
  send back
    call io/file-remove
      read path

task copy-file
  take from, like text
  take to, like text
  like void
  send back
    call io/file-copy
      read from
      read to

task move-file
  take from, like text
  take to, like text
  like void
  send back
    call io/file-move
      read from
      read to

task file-exists
  take path, like text
  like boolean
  send back
    call io/file-exists
      read path
